@startuml projet10_diagramme_etats_cycle_image_projet
!theme plain

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "DejaVu Sans"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #145A86
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #EAF6FF
  BorderColor #145A86
  FontColor #0B2A45
  AttributeFontColor #0B2A45
  StartColor #2E7D32
  EndColor #C62828
}

title Projet 10 - Diagramme d'etats du cycle de vie d'une image
right footer David MEDRAGH projet10

[*] --> Image_brute
Image_brute : Image presente\ndans le dataset

Image_brute --> Image_exploree : Etape 1
Image_exploree : Resolution, format,\nmode couleur verifies

Image_exploree --> Image_vectorisee : Etape 2
Image_vectorisee : Embedding ResNet50\n2 048 dimensions

Image_vectorisee --> Image_clusterisee : Etape 3
Image_clusterisee : K-Means / DBSCAN\ncluster attribue

Image_clusterisee --> Image_pseudo_labellisee : Si image sans label
Image_clusterisee --> Image_fortement_labellisee : Si label expert

Image_pseudo_labellisee --> Image_entrainement_semi : Etape 4
Image_fortement_labellisee --> Image_train_val_test : Split anti-fuite

Image_train_val_test --> Image_entrainement_supervise : Si train / val
Image_train_val_test --> Image_test_final : Si test

Image_entrainement_semi --> Prediction_modele_B
Image_entrainement_supervise --> Prediction_modele_A
Image_test_final --> Prediction_modele_A
Image_test_final --> Prediction_modele_B

Prediction_modele_A --> [*]
Prediction_modele_B --> [*]

@enduml
